# QA M3 flow (D-017, D-025, D-047): game over in Falkenstein -> continue
# restarts Falkenstein from its start. Title flow with the run started at
# Falkenstein: the solver route to the saddle's take-off, then a walk into
# the saddle cleft (death 1 at 1625, after the checkpoint); respawn at the
# checkpoint (col 116) after the stage intro; twice a hop LEFT over the
# curb into the Steinschlag cleft (deaths 2 and 3 at 1988 and 2350; since
# the QA fix, walking left alone is stopped by the curb); game over at
# 2410. START -> the Falkenstein intro and play at the Fürberg jetty
# (hitbox top 618 on row 40, not the checkpoint's 394), 3 lives, score 0,
# 0 Oblaten.
level  = falkenstein
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = deaths=3 event=GameOver dies_at frames=2350..2350
expect = state=playing stage=falkenstein lives=3 score=0 oblaten=0 power=normal player_y>=618 player_y<=618
---
- 20
S 1       # title -> Falkenstein intro
- 150
