# --- end of the first 1366 frames of falkenstein_solver.replay ---
R 100     # into the saddle cleft: death 1 (1625)
- 250     # intro, respawn at the checkpoint (col 116, behind the curb)
L 6       # left: the curb (115) stops a walk ...
LJ 16     # ... so she hops it on purpose
L 50      # into the Steinschlag cleft: death 2 (1988)
- 290
L 6
LJ 16
L 50      # again: death 3 (2350), game over (2410)
- 150
S 1       # continue
- 200     # Falkenstein intro, then play from the start
